摘要中的主要功能必须被所选片段支持。优先把改变用途含义的条件写进摘要，不能只藏在limitations。遇到“阶段1骨架”“cloud provider待实现”“匿名thread后续实现”等，摘要明确当前仅本地草稿/审批落盘，不说已实现匿名网络或云端发布。Codex/模型登录适配归coding-development；Oopz等语音房的对话连接归communication-integrations。自述兼容或性能用“作者称/README注明”，不冒充本次验证。
格式示例（仅结构，不是来源事实）：evidence:[{"paragraph_id":"p3s1","fact":"该片段支持的中文转述"}]。请从本次真实输入挑选编号。","role":"system"},{"content":"{"metadata":{"description":"Credential-safe Wind AIFin MCP and Alice integration for DeepSeek Harness.","id":"gh:1299508956","install_available":true,"language":"JavaScript","name":"dsh-wind-aifin","slug":"Xiamu-ssr/dsh-wind-aifin","topics":["deepseek-harness","dsh-plugin","finance","mcp","wind-aifin"]},"paragraphs":[{"id":"p1s1","text":"Credential-safe Wind AIFin MCP and Alice integration for DeepSeek Harness."},{"id":"p2s1","text":"# dsh-wind-aifin"},{"id":"p3s1","text":"Credential-safe Wind AIFin integration for\nDeepSeek Harness (DSH)."},{"id":"p4s1","text":"简体中文"},{"id":"p5s1","text":"## What it provides"},{"id":"p6s1","text":"- Seven official Wind Streamable HTTP MCP domains are connected through DSH's\nown `@deepseek-ai/dsh-"},{"id":"p6s2","text":"mcp-client` and exposed as native tools:\n`wind_stock`, `wind_fund`, `wind_index`, `wind_bond`, `wind"},{"id":"p6s3","text":"_docs`,\n`wind_economic`, and `wind_analytics`.\n- `wind_alice` invokes Wind Alice's professional fina"},{"id":"p6s4","text":"ncial-analysis workflows,\nincluding fact checking, company one-pagers, earnings reviews, screening,\n"},{"id":"p6s5","text":"macro, bond, credit, fund, market-sizing, and comparable-company analysis.\n- Two runtime Skills teac"},{"id":"p6s6","text":"h the agent how to route requests without putting an\nAPI key or shell commands into the prompt.\n- A "},{"id":"p6s7","text":"Settings namespace declares `WIND_API_KEY` as a DSH credential reference."},{"id":"p7s1","text":"## Why a plugin is needed"},{"id":"p8s1","text":"DSH intentionally removes credential-shaped environment variables from\nmodel-visible shell processes"},{"id":"p8s2","text":". Putting `WIND_API_KEY` in the host environment\ntherefore does not make the official Wind CLI avail"},{"id":"p8s3","text":"able to an Agent's Bash\ntool—and copying the key into the workspace would defeat the boundary."},{"id":"p9s1","text":"This plugin resolves the credential inside the trusted host process. Wind MCP\ntraffic passes through"},{"id":"p9s2","text":" a random, loopback-only adapter that injects the Bearer\ntoken and then delegates protocol handling "},{"id":"p9s3","text":"and tool registration to DSH's MCP\nclient. Alice resolves the same credential per operation. The key"},{"id":"p9s4","text":" is never\nreturned to the model, stored in plugin configuration, or exposed to ordinary\nBash command"},{"id":"p9s5","text":"s never\nreturned to the model, stored in plugin configuration, or exposed to ordinary\nBash commands."},{"id":"p10s1","text":"## Install"},{"id":"p11s1","text":"DSH `0.1.0-rc.8` or newer is recommended."},{"id":"p12s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p13s1","text":"Restart the profile after installation. Install into another profile by\nreplacing `web` with that pr"},{"id":"p13s2","text":"rofile after installation. Install into another profile by\nreplacing `web` with that profile's name."},{"id":"p14s1","text":"## Configure"},{"id":"p15s1","text":"Create a Wind AIFin API key at the\nWind developer portal, then\nstore it as the DSH credential refere"},{"id":"p15s2","text":"nce `WIND_API_KEY` using the Credentials\npage. A deployment may instead provide `WIND_API_KEY` in th"},{"id":"p15s3","text":"e trusted DSH launch\nenvironment."},{"id":"p16s1","text":"Do not put the key in a workspace file, Skill file, prompt, MCP headers in\n`cordis.patch.yml`, or a "},{"id":"p16s2","text":"model-visible shell profile."},{"id":"p17s1","text":"## Tool names"},{"id":"p18s1","text":"MCP tools follow DSH's standard qualified naming convention:"},{"id":"p19s1","text":"| Domain | Prefix |"},{"id":"p20s1","text":"| Stocks | `mcp__wind_stock__` |\n| Funds and ETFs | `mcp__wind_fund__` |\n| Indices and sectors | `mc"},{"id":"p20s2","text":"p__wind_index__` |\n| Bonds | `mcp__wind_bond__` |\n| Filings and financial news | `mcp__wind_docs__` "},{"id":"p20s3","text":"|\n| Macro and industry indicators | `mcp__wind_economic__` |\n| Cross-asset analytics | `mcp__wind_an"},{"id":"p20s4","text":"d industry indicators | `mcp__wind_economic__` |\n| Cross-asset analytics | `mcp__wind_analytics__` |"},{"id":"p21s1","text":"Wind Alice is exposed as `wind_alice` and accepts a prompt plus an optional\nprofessional workflow na"},{"id":"p21s2","text":"d Alice is exposed as `wind_alice` and accepts a prompt plus an optional\nprofessional workflow name."},{"id":"p22s1","text":"## Security and data flow"},{"id":"p23s1","text":"- The credential adapter listens only on `127.0.0.1` and uses an unguessable\nper-process route.\n- Th"},{"id":"p23s2","text":"e adapter accepts only the seven fixed Wind endpoints; users cannot turn it\ninto a general authentic"},{"id":"p23s3","text":"ated proxy.\n- Credentials are resolved for each request and are not cached in files.\n- Financial req"},{"id":"p23s4","text":"uests and selected context are sent to Wind's service. Review\nWind's service terms before sending co"},{"id":"p23s5","text":"nfidential information.\n- This plugin has no install script and does not bundle or redistribute Wind"},{"id":"p23s6","text":"'s\nofficial Skills repository."},{"id":"p24s1","text":"In version `0.1.0`, Alice's final textual/data artifact is returned to the\nAgent; Alice-generated do"},{"id":"p24s2","text":"wnloadable files are not automatically copied into the\nDSH workspace."},{"id":"p25s1","text":"## Development"},{"id":"p26s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p27s1","text":"See SECURITY.md for vulnerability reporting and the trust\nboundary. This is a community adapter and "},{"id":"p27s2","text":"is not an official Wind product."}],"truncated":false}","role":"user"}],"model":"MiniMax-M3.1-Flash","reasoning_effort":"low","stream":false}
